      "question_id": "#40",
      "topic_id": 1,
      "course_id": 1,
      "case_study_id": null,
      "lab_id": 0,
      "question_text": "<p>A healthcare company stares mare than 1 million patient records in an Amazon S3 bucket. The patient records include personally identifiable information (Pit). The S3 bucket contains hundreds of terabytes of data.<br><br>A security engineer receives an alert that was triggered by an Amazon GuardDuty Exfiltration:S3/AnomalousBehavior finding. The security engineer confirms that an attacker is using temporary credentials that were obtained from a compromised Amazon EC2 instance that has s3:GetObject permissions for the S3 bucket. The attacker has begun downloading the contents of the bucket. The security engineer contacts a development team. The development team will require 4 hours to implement and deploy a fix.<br><br>The security engineer must take immediate action to prevent the attacker from downloading more data from the S3 bucket.<br><br>Which solution will moot this requirement?<br><br></p>",
      "mark": 1,
      "is_partially_correct": false,
      "question_type": "1",
      "difficulty_level": "0",
      "general_feedback": "<p><strong>✅ ĐÁP ÁN ĐÚNG</strong>: D</p><p><strong>🎯 ĐỀ ĐANG HỎI GÌ?</strong></p><ul><li>Attacker đang tải dữ liệu từ S3 bằng temporary credentials của EC2 instance profile bị compromise.</li><li>Phải chặn NGAY việc download trong khi dev cần 4 giờ để fix.</li></ul><p><strong>💡 LÝ DO CHỌN ĐÁP ÁN</strong></p><p>Một <strong>S3 bucket policy</strong> deny read tạm thời có hiệu lực ngay trên chính bucket, chặn mọi download bất kể credential, đảm bảo dừng exfiltration ngay.</p><p><strong>⚡ PHÂN TÍCH NHANH</strong></p><ul><li><strong>A</strong>: ⚠️ Có thể nhưng không tối ưu — revoke session giúp chặn credential cũ nhưng attacker vẫn lấy được credential mới nếu instance còn bị compromise.</li><li><strong>B</strong>: ❌ Sai — security group không có outbound rule vẫn không ngắt kết nối đã có, và attacker dùng credential từ bên ngoài vẫn gọi S3 API được.</li><li><strong>C</strong>: ❌ Sai — Macie chỉ phát hiện/phân loại, Object Lock không chặn đọc.</li><li><strong>D</strong>: ✅ Đúng — deny read ở bucket policy, hiệu lực tức thì.</li></ul><p><strong>🔑 KEYWORDS CẦN NHỚ</strong>: Exfiltration:S3/AnomalousBehavior, bucket policy deny, immediate containment</p><p><strong>🧠 MẸO THI</strong>: Gặp \"chặn tải dữ liệu S3 ngay lập tức\" → nghĩ ngay đến <strong>bucket policy Deny</strong>.</p>",
      "is_active": true,
      "answer_list": [
        {
          "question_answer_id": 1,
          "question_id": "#40",
          "answers": [
            {
              "choice": "<p>Revoke the temporary session that is associated with the instance profile that is attached to the EC2 instance.</p>",
              "correct": false,
              "feedback": ""
            },
            {
              "choice": "<p>Quarantine the EC2 instance by replacing the existing security group with a new security group that has no rules applied.</p>",
              "correct": false,
              "feedback": ""
            },
            {
              "choice": "<p>Enable Amazon Made on the S3 bucket. Configure the managed data identifiers for personally identifiable information (PII). Enable S3 Object Lock on objects that Macie flags.</p>",
              "correct": false,
              "feedback": ""
            },
            {
              "choice": "<p>Apply an S3 bucket policy temporarily. Configure the policy to deny read access for all principals to block downloads while the development team address the vulnerability.</p>",
              "correct": true,
              "feedback": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
