          "date": "March 21, 2026 02:14 pm",
          "username": "gonzales",
          "content": "The requirement is a disaster recovery solution with an RPO of 1 hour for both the EC2/EBS-backed frontend tier and the S3-stored image/music data. AWS Backup supports protecting both Amazon EBS/EC2-related backups and Amazon S3, and backup plans can run as frequently as hourly, which matches the 1-hour RPO requirement.<br/><br><br/><br>Use CloudFormation templates to recreate the architecture, which is appropriate for disaster recovery and recovery-to-normal-operations after a ransomware event. Using source control for those templates and app configuration supports repeatable rebuilds",
