          "content": "Because with the question.<br/><br><br/><br>My understanding is it’s asking to isolates a specific EC2 instance even with existing connections. Each subnet contains multiple instances so change ACL may not be a good idea. <br/><br><br/><br>Thus, add security group with allowing all and then remove it again will kill existing sessions",
          "upvote_count": "2 times",
