      "question_text": "<p>A company recently set up Amazon GuardDuty and is receiving a high number of findings from IP addresses within the company. A security engineer has verified that these IP addresses are trusted and allowed.<br><br>Which combination of steps should the security engineer take to configure GuardDuty so that it does not produce findings for these IP addresses? (Choose two.)<br><br></p>",
