      "question_id": "#69",
      "topic_id": 1,
      "course_id": 1,
      "case_study_id": null,
      "lab_id": 0,
      "question_text": "<p>A company has two AWS accounts: Account A and Account B. Each account has a VPC. An application that runs in the VPC in Account A needs to write to an Amazon S3 bucket in Account B. The application in Account A already has permission to write to the S3 bucket in Account B.<br><br><br><br>The application and the S3 bucket are in the same AWS Region. The company cannot send network traffic over the public internet.<br><br><br><br>Which solution will meet these requirements?<br><br></p>",
      "mark": 1,
      "is_partially_correct": false,
      "question_type": "1",
      "difficulty_level": "0",
      "general_feedback": "<p><strong>✅ ĐÁP ÁN ĐÚNG</strong>: D</p><p><strong>🎯 ĐỀ ĐANG HỎI GÌ?</strong></p><ul><li>Ứng dụng trong VPC ghi vào S3 bucket của account khác, không đi qua public internet.</li><li>Requirement chính: private connectivity đến S3, cùng Region.</li></ul><p><strong>💡 LÝ DO CHỌN ĐÁP ÁN</strong></p><p>Gateway VPC endpoint cho S3 đưa traffic qua mạng AWS, không qua internet. Permission cross-account đã có sẵn.</p><p><strong>⚡ PHÂN TÍCH NHANH</strong></p><ul><li><strong>A</strong>: ❌ Sai — Transit Gateway nối VPC, không truy cập S3.</li><li><strong>B</strong>: ❌ Sai — VPN là overkill và S3 không nằm trong VPC.</li><li><strong>C</strong>: ❌ Sai — VPC peering không giúp truy cập S3 bucket.</li><li><strong>D</strong>: ✅ Đúng — gateway VPC endpoint cho S3 và cập nhật route table.</li></ul><p><strong>🔑 KEYWORDS CẦN NHỚ</strong></p><p>gateway VPC endpoint, Amazon S3, private connectivity, route table</p><p><strong>🧠 MẸO THI</strong></p><p>\"Gặp truy cập S3 không qua internet → nghĩ ngay đến gateway VPC endpoint.\"</p>",
      "is_active": true,
      "answer_list": [
        {
          "question_answer_id": 1,
          "question_id": "#69",
          "answers": [
            {
              "choice": "<p>In both accounts, create a transit gateway and VPC attachments in a subnet in each Availability Zone. Update the VPC route tables.</p>",
              "correct": false,
              "feedback": ""
            },
            {
              "choice": "<p>Deploy a software VPN appliance in Account A. Create a VPN connection between the software VPN appliance and a virtual private gateway in Account B.</p>",
              "correct": false,
              "feedback": ""
            },
            {
              "choice": "<p>Create a VPC peering connection between the VPC in Account A and the VPC in Account B. Update the VPC route tables, network ACLs, and security groups to allow network traffic between the peered IP ranges.</p>",
              "correct": false,
              "feedback": ""
            },
            {
              "choice": "<p>In Account A, create a gateway VPC endpoint for Amazon S3. Update the VPC route table in Account A.</p>",
              "correct": true,
              "feedback": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "topic_name": "Exam AWS Certified Security - Specialty SCS-C03 topic 1 question 69 discussion - ExamTopics",
