          "content": "Update: It's A.<br/><br>An AWS WAF rate-based rule tracks the volume of incoming requests from specific web clients and automatically triggers a mitigation action—such as blocking, counting, or challenging traffic—when that volume exceeds a defined threshold within a specific timeframe.",
